# A Sarachnis trip on the trip plaque: it starts when she is in sight, counts the kill from the
# game's kill count message, warns when the prayer runs low, and ends at logout.
# Facts: scenes/sarachnis.scene. The kill count message is the game's ("Your Sarachnis kill count
# is: 52.", the form core/Chat reads).
include /replays/scenes/sarachnis.scene
watch line0 tripPlaque.shown.lines.0.text
watch line1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.text
tick 3
expect title = null

npc SARACHNIS Sarachnis 1842 9905 2 level 318 as boss
tick 4
expect over = "BOSS PILOT: ON A TRIP"
expect title = Sarachnis
expect line0 ~ "0 kills"

# A kill, with most of the supplies gone: one prayer potion left of four.
items INV clear
items INV SHARK 4
items INV _4DOSEPRAYERRESTORE 1
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Sarachnis kill count is: 52."
tick 4
expect line0 ~ "1 kill in"
expect line1 = "Bank after this kill: your prayer is nearly gone"
expect saved.logbookV1 ~ :52,           # the kill count, saved: "kc":52

# Logging out ends the trip.
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
expect title = null
